<title>USA: TABLE - Consolidated Graphics Q1 shr rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Consolidated Graphics Q1 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended June 30</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.30		    $0.14</p>
<p> Net			  3,860		    1,673</p>
<p> Revs			50,675		   28,258</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  12,949		   11,860</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Consolidated Graphics Inc.</p>
<p>Q1 sales and earnings were driven by the company's acquisition program, internal growth and operating improvements at the printing companies.</p>
